%% Sequence — internal contact lookup (auth-service)
%% Recreated from "Internal contact lookup flow.png" by Thulani Jayathilake (Role 2); original kept as
%% ../Internal contact lookup flow-original.png
%% Fix: /internal/** is protected by X-Internal-Token (ADR-010, common), not by a user's bearer JWT, as the code and
%% InternalUserControllerTest show. Not routed by the gateway.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant NS as notification-service
    participant F as common internal-token filter<br/>(in auth-service)
    participant C as InternalUserController
    participant DB as auth_db

    NS->>F: GET /internal/users/{userId}/contact<br/>X-Internal-Token (InternalRestClientFactory)
    F->>F: compare with INTERNAL_API_TOKEN (constant time)
    alt missing or wrong token
        F-->>NS: 401 ProblemDetail
    else valid
        F->>C: forward as ROLE_INTERNAL_SERVICE
        C->>DB: find user by id
        alt unknown user
            C-->>NS: 404 ProblemDetail
        else found
            C-->>NS: 200 {email, phone, firstName}
        end
    end
    Note over NS,C: personal data: private network only, never logged unmasked, never put in events
